# Build order for syn-pkg.zsh: one recipe name (pkgs/NAME) per line.
# Each package comes after everything it needs. Comment a line out to skip
# a package; `build.zsh desktop NAME` rebuilds one on its own.
#
# Categories and profiles. A `# [category]` header puts the recipes under
# it in that category; a profile is the set of categories it builds, and
# only filters the sequence below, never reorders it. SYN_OS_PROFILE picks
# one for build.zsh fetch and desktop (default full).
profile full    baseCore netAndServices shellAndCLI desktopStack fontsI18n appsMedia synOS
profile minimal baseCore netAndServices shellAndCLI desktopStack fontsI18n synOS
# minimal: a desktop that boots. Leaves out appsMedia — the browser, and Steam
# with its 32-bit tree. synOS is on every profile.

